<section class="inchy-shell inchy-section inchy-chapter" id="what-is-inchy">
  <span class="inchy-chapter__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
  <div class="inchy-chapter__body">
  <header class="inchy-chapter-heading"><p class="inchy-kicker">THE NUTRACEUTICAL</p><h2 class="inchy-section-title">WHAT IS {% render 'inchy-logo', inline: true %}?</h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-intro__copy">
    <h3 class="inchy-feature-heading">PROTEIN + FIBER.<span class="inchy-seed-line">ONE REMARKABLE SEED.</span></h3>
    <p>INCHY is a nutraceutical brand focused on satiety.</p>
    <h3 class="inchy-feature-heading inchy-form-intro">MEET FORM1.</h3>
    <p>Our first formulation. An unflavored sacha inchi nutraceutical powder, made for everyday use. Through our proprietary process, developed over years, we bring the seed’s protein and fiber together in a functional ingredient designed to mix into food or drinks.</p>
    <p>One preparation. Both components. This is INCHY FORM1.</p>
    <details class="inchy-disclosure" id="our-process"><summary>WHAT MAKES OUR PROCESS DIFFERENT?</summary><div>
      <p>Our proprietary process begins with respect for the seed. Developed over years, it brings sacha inchi into a form shaped around taste, texture and everyday preparation.</p>
      <p>We keep protein and fiber from the same seed together in the finished ingredient. When we talk about the food matrix, we mean the way an ingredient’s components are held together. Processing changes that structure; keeping both components does not mean leaving the seed untouched.</p>
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=process">Explore our process →</a>
    </div></details>
    <dl class="inchy-facts">
      <div><dt>FORMAT</dt><dd>UNFLAVOURED POWDER</dd></div>
      <div><dt>CONTAINS</dt><dd>NO SWEETENERS. NO FLAVOURS. NO ADDITIVES.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <a class="inchy-text-link" href="{% render 'inchy-shop-url' %}">EXPLORE FORM1 →</a>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

